Package: rngb
Type: Package
Title: Read NETZSCH STA NGB Measurement Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Valery", "Fischer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "valery.fischer@example.org"), person("Grayson", "Bellamy", role = "cph", comment = "Original pyngb parser and format knowledge"))
Description: A native R reader for NETZSCH simultaneous thermal analysis
    sample-plus-correction (.ngb-ds3) and baseline (.ngb-bs3) files.
    Extracts metadata, raw measurement channels, and embedded baseline runs.
    Based on the MIT-licensed pyngb format parser. No Python or vendor
    software is required. This is an unofficial implementation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: utils
